1.Create a smoke test checklist for the login and dashboard features of a food delivery app like Zomato, listing at least 5 key test cases that would quickly verify if the main flows work after a new build.
Answer :
 >Login with valid credentials – User should log in successfully.
 >Login with invalid credentials – Appropriate error message should be displayed.
